*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
							This set of scripts is for polishing weapon animations
							It is especially relevant for game animators.
*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
									Make Sword 
*********************************************************************************************************************************************************	
	what is he doing?

				allows you to adjust the trajectory of the tip of the weapon, which itself rotates and moves in the palm
				the correction will be transmitted to the wrist while maintaining the relative rotation of the weapon, 
				and the length of the entire arm will not change
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	how it work	
				bakes the rotation of the selected object (weapon and wrist) 
				by 3 locators, one of which controls the TOP of rotation, and the second SIDE
				and additional system with special locator transmitting hand movement
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	usage		
				After launch, 2 locators will appear, the first highlighted - TOP - immediately pull it to the top of the weapon. 
				After that, either with the button in the menu - or with the standard hotkey - arrow to the right 
				- select SIDE and pull it in the perpendicular direction - towards the blade.
				And when everything is ready, click on an empty spot in the scene. The script is recalculated
				
*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
									Make Reverse
*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
	what is he doing?
				allows you to fix the weapon at any point (for example, if it stumbles into the ground)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	how it work	
				bakes the rotation of the selected object (weapon and wrist(and something else)) 
				by 3 locators, one of which controls the TOP of rotation, the second SIDE
				and PIVOT of weapon
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	usage		
				After launch, 3 locators will appear, 
				the first highlighted PIVOT - move it to the place where you want to fix the weapon
				After that, either with the button in the menu - or with the standard hotkey - arrow to the right 
				select - TOP - immediately pull it to the weapon hilt. 
				After that, either with the button in the menu - or with the standard hotkey - arrow to the right 
				- select SIDE and pull it in the perpendicular direction - towards the blade.
				And when everything is ready, click on an empty spot in the scene. The script is recalculated			